      "id": "s7",
      "concept": "types of corrosion",
      "narration": "Corrosion types include pitting, galvanic, and uniform corrosion. Pitting occurs in crevices, galvanic when dissimilar metals touch, and uniform corrosion spreads evenly. Each has different causes and prevention methods.",
